WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.208 --> 00:00:32.583
In the previous verses, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:32.583 --> 00:00:34.791
spoke about those devotees

3
00:00:34.791 --> 00:00:37.875
who worship Him with a pure heart.

4
00:00:37.875 --> 00:00:39.583
Now in this verse, Lord Krishna

5
00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:41.625
describes those devotees

6
00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:43.750
who in different ways

7
00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.583
worship Him indirectly.

8
00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:50.041
Every person has their own
journey to reach God.

9
00:00:50.041 --> 00:00:53.458
Some worship Lord Krishna directly,

10
00:00:53.458 --> 00:00:55.916
while some through various concepts

11
00:00:55.916 --> 00:00:58.541
try to understand Him.

12
00:00:58.541 --> 00:01:01.333
Let us see what Lord Krishna

13
00:01:01.333 --> 00:01:05.333
says about these different paths of worship.

14
00:01:10.416 --> 00:01:12.500
In this verse, Lord Krishna

15
00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:13.791
mentions three types

16
00:01:13.791 --> 00:01:15.750
of jnana-yajna,

17
00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:17.000
through which people

18
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.708
worship Him indirectly.

19
00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:22.541
The first type is 'ekatvena.'

20
00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:24.291
These are those people who see Lord

21
00:01:24.291 --> 00:01:27.416
Krishna as undivided oneness.

22
00:01:27.416 --> 00:01:30.666
These worshippers consider themselves
 inseparable from the Supreme

23
00:01:30.666 --> 00:01:35.000
and say – 'I am one with God.'

24
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:38.250
This view resembles Brahman philosophy,

25
00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:40.666
but differs from Mayavada,

26
00:01:40.666 --> 00:01:44.250
because it does not consider
 Lord Krishna's form an illusion.

27
00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:47.500
Such people recognise 
the spiritual nature of the soul

28
00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.083
and through their soul's

29
00:01:49.083 --> 00:01:52.041
oneness with the eternal truth,

30
00:01:52.041 --> 00:01:55.291
through meditation seek liberation.

31
00:01:55.291 --> 00:01:57.666
Though this understanding rises above

32
00:01:57.666 --> 00:01:59.208
materialistic thinking,

33
00:01:59.208 --> 00:02:02.291
it still lacks the feeling of devotion to

34
00:02:02.291 --> 00:02:04.166
Lord Krishna's personal form.

35
00:02:04.166 --> 00:02:07.458
The second type is 'prithaktvena bahudha.'

36
00:02:07.458 --> 00:02:09.583
In this category come those worshippers

37
00:02:09.583 --> 00:02:12.041
who see God in many forms,

38
00:02:12.041 --> 00:02:14.750
such as in the form of other deities,

39
00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:16.250
and worship these forms

40
00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:18.833
as representatives of the Supreme.

41
00:02:18.833 --> 00:02:21.375
For example, they worship the sun,

42
00:02:21.375 --> 00:02:24.416
the moon, or other deities,

43
00:02:24.416 --> 00:02:27.541
seeing them as parts of Lord Krishna's power.

44
00:02:27.541 --> 00:02:28.708
This worship accepts

45
00:02:28.708 --> 00:02:31.375
various deities as controllers of different

46
00:02:31.375 --> 00:02:33.916
aspects of the universe,

47
00:02:33.916 --> 00:02:35.750
but does not fully recognise

48
00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.375
Lord Krishna as the sole

49
00:02:37.375 --> 00:02:40.708
source of all these expressions.

50
00:02:40.708 --> 00:02:42.375
And the third type is

51
00:02:42.375 --> 00:02:44.375
'vishvato-mukham.'

52
00:02:44.375 --> 00:02:47.625
This is worship of Lord Krishna's universal form,

53
00:02:47.625 --> 00:02:49.291
where the entire universe

54
00:02:49.291 --> 00:02:51.958
is seen as His body.

55
00:02:51.958 --> 00:02:54.625
Such worshippers see the vastness

56
00:02:54.625 --> 00:02:56.666
and grandeur of the universe

57
00:02:56.666 --> 00:02:59.291
as a reflection of the Supreme.

58
00:02:59.291 --> 00:03:01.250
Mountains, rivers,

59
00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:02.875
stars, and other elements

60
00:03:02.875 --> 00:03:04.916
are God's limbs for them,

61
00:03:04.916 --> 00:03:06.625
and the universal form becomes

62
00:03:06.625 --> 00:03:09.083
the centre of their meditation and devotion.

63
00:03:09.083 --> 00:03:10.750
Have you ever thought

64
00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:13.333
about how you connect with God?

65
00:03:13.333 --> 00:03:15.125
Although all these perspectives

66
00:03:15.125 --> 00:03:17.666
are a step toward spiritual understanding,

67
00:03:17.666 --> 00:03:18.416
still

68
00:03:18.416 --> 00:03:20.000
they remain indirect

69
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.916
and lack the fullness of personal, pure

70
00:03:21.916 --> 00:03:25.041
devotion to Lord Krishna.

71
00:03:25.041 --> 00:03:27.416
In the coming verses, Lord Krishna will explain

72
00:03:27.416 --> 00:03:28.916
why direct devotion to Him

73
00:03:28.916 --> 00:03:31.041
is supreme.

74
00:03:31.041 --> 00:03:33.958
By revealing these different forms of worship,

75
00:03:33.958 --> 00:03:35.750
Lord Krishna shows that

76
00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:37.041
every person

77
00:03:37.041 --> 00:03:39.791
according to their own
understanding and nature

78
00:03:39.791 --> 00:03:42.500
forms a connection with Him.

79
00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:45.541
This reveals His all-pervading nature,

80
00:03:45.541 --> 00:03:48.791
because He accepts diverse worship

81
00:03:48.791 --> 00:03:50.708
in diverse forms.

82
00:03:50.708 --> 00:03:51.958
Even when

83
00:03:51.958 --> 00:03:52.708
the worshipper

84
00:03:52.708 --> 00:03:54.291
does not fully understand

85
00:03:54.291 --> 00:03:57.333
His supreme reality.

86
00:03:57.333 --> 00:04:00.541
From this it becomes clear that the Lord's heart

87
00:04:00.541 --> 00:04:03.250
sees only the sincerity of feeling,

88
00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:06.083
not the completeness of knowledge.

89
00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.541
Every person's path of living life

90
00:04:14.541 --> 00:04:16.708
is different,

91
00:04:16.708 --> 00:04:18.875
and every person

92
00:04:18.875 --> 00:04:23.291
walks in their life according to themselves,

93
00:04:23.291 --> 00:04:27.041
carving their own path.

94
00:04:27.041 --> 00:04:30.666
Just as a traveller through many routes

95
00:04:30.666 --> 00:04:34.166
can reach their destination,

96
00:04:34.166 --> 00:04:39.375
in the same way you too
 can find solutions to your problems

97
00:04:39.375 --> 00:04:42.750
in many different ways.

98
00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:46.833
Now tell Me –

99
00:04:46.833 --> 00:04:51.208
do you seek solutions to life's problems

100
00:04:51.208 --> 00:04:55.375
through logic or through intuition?

101
00:04:55.375 --> 00:05:00.041
Do you focus on immediate results

102
00:05:00.041 --> 00:05:05.250
or look for deeper meaning in every action?

103
00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:09.750
Neither of these approaches is wrong.

104
00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:13.458
This is simply the picture

105
00:05:13.458 --> 00:05:16.750
of your current journey.

106
00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:20.000
Just as a flowing stream

107
00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:24.208
makes its own path, in the same way

108
00:05:24.208 --> 00:05:28.833
you too choose your own way.

109
00:05:28.833 --> 00:05:30.750
But

110
00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:33.416
do you stay on your chosen

111
00:05:33.416 --> 00:05:36.666
path firmly only because

112
00:05:36.666 --> 00:05:40.666
it feels safe to you?

113
00:05:40.666 --> 00:05:47.125
Or are you also open to new possibilities?

114
00:05:47.125 --> 00:05:49.041
Suppose

115
00:05:49.041 --> 00:05:51.583
that one day

116
00:05:51.583 --> 00:05:55.291
you find yourself in a situation

117
00:05:55.291 --> 00:06:01.208
where your logic does not support you.

118
00:06:01.208 --> 00:06:04.833
Here your intuition tells you

119
00:06:04.833 --> 00:06:07.750
to choose a different path.

120
00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:09.291
So will

121
00:06:09.291 --> 00:06:14.125
you have the courage to leave your old path

122
00:06:14.125 --> 00:06:18.250
and take the new one?

123
00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:20.791
Growth comes only

124
00:06:20.791 --> 00:06:25.375
when you recognise that your path

125
00:06:25.375 --> 00:06:29.750
is not the only right path.

126
00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:33.541
Water rises from a well too,

127
00:06:33.541 --> 00:06:36.666
it rises from a mountain spring too,

128
00:06:36.666 --> 00:06:40.625
it rises from the source of a river too.

129
00:06:40.625 --> 00:06:44.750
In the same way, sources
 of different perspectives

130
00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:49.083
can each offer the water of truth.

131
00:06:49.083 --> 00:06:51.625
Ask yourself –

132
00:06:51.625 --> 00:06:54.666
am I ready to see

133
00:06:54.666 --> 00:06:58.375
beyond my limited understanding?

134
00:06:58.375 --> 00:07:02.750
Stay open to accepting new ideas.

135
00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:06.916
Break free from your old limitations

136
00:07:06.916 --> 00:07:11.583
and allow yourself to change.

137
00:07:11.583 --> 00:07:13.875
Remember,

138
00:07:13.875 --> 00:07:16.166
your journey does not need

139
00:07:16.166 --> 00:07:17.375
to look like

140
00:07:17.375 --> 00:07:22.250
anyone else's journey.

141
00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.208
What is important

142
00:07:24.208 --> 00:07:27.000
is that you move forward

143
00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:31.041
with honesty and the desire to grow.

144
00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:37.500
In a family,

145
00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:40.958
different views are natural.

146
00:07:40.958 --> 00:07:44.666
Every member has their own perspective,

147
00:07:44.666 --> 00:07:47.833
shaped by their experiences, values,

148
00:07:47.833 --> 00:07:52.708
and understanding.

149
00:07:52.708 --> 00:07:55.375
Have you ever thought

150
00:07:55.375 --> 00:07:58.500
that conflicts usually do not arise

151
00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:02.625
because someone is right or wrong?

152
00:08:02.625 --> 00:08:06.041
But because our attention

153
00:08:06.041 --> 00:08:11.833
shifts from shared values to differences.

154
00:08:11.833 --> 00:08:14.458
Pause for a moment

155
00:08:14.458 --> 00:08:17.000
and think.

156
00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:20.958
What is the essence of family life?

157
00:08:20.958 --> 00:08:25.708
Love, connection, and cooperation. Is it not?

158
00:08:25.708 --> 00:08:29.458
Imagine – in a family, the father wants

159
00:08:29.458 --> 00:08:30.500
the child

160
00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.750
to become a scientist, while the mother wants

161
00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:36.375
the child to become an artist.

162
00:08:36.375 --> 00:08:39.750
Both may be right from their own perspective,

163
00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:41.416
but

164
00:08:41.416 --> 00:08:42.625
if they

165
00:08:42.625 --> 00:08:47.250
focus on the fact that both their goals

166
00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:51.041
are the child's happiness and success,

167
00:08:51.041 --> 00:08:55.416
they can find a path

168
00:08:55.416 --> 00:08:58.250
where the child, according to their talent

169
00:08:58.250 --> 00:09:01.958
and interest, can move forward.

170
00:09:01.958 --> 00:09:05.083
When differences arise,

171
00:09:05.083 --> 00:09:08.833
instead of staying stuck on who

172
00:09:08.833 --> 00:09:14.208
said what, take a step back and ask –

173
00:09:14.208 --> 00:09:18.625
what truly matters here?

174
00:09:18.625 --> 00:09:22.041
Just as on the thread of a garland,

175
00:09:22.041 --> 00:09:26.250
different beads are strung together,

176
00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:29.875
in the same way all family members,

177
00:09:29.875 --> 00:09:32.583
even with their diversity,

178
00:09:32.583 --> 00:09:36.000
can remain united by one thread.

179
00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:37.958
Just as

180
00:09:37.958 --> 00:09:39.625
I

181
00:09:39.625 --> 00:09:40.916
accept different

182
00:09:40.916 --> 00:09:45.083
paths of worship, in the same way

183
00:09:45.083 --> 00:09:48.291
a family flourishes

184
00:09:48.291 --> 00:09:49.375
when it

185
00:09:49.375 --> 00:09:52.625
honours individual differences

186
00:09:52.625 --> 00:09:57.375
while staying connected to shared values.

187
00:09:57.375 --> 00:09:59.541
Can you in your family

188
00:09:59.541 --> 00:10:04.625
adopt this perspective?

189
00:10:04.625 --> 00:10:07.083
Teach your family

190
00:10:07.083 --> 00:10:12.000
to rise above immediate disagreements.

191
00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:15.541
Make a joint effort to protect harmony.

192
00:10:15.541 --> 00:10:17.750
By focusing on the essence

193
00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:20.041
of your shared bond,

194
00:10:20.041 --> 00:10:23.291
you not only resolve conflicts,

195
00:10:23.291 --> 00:10:26.458
but also build a culture

196
00:10:26.458 --> 00:10:30.041
of respect and understanding

197
00:10:30.041 --> 00:10:34.083
that strengthens the entire family.

198
00:10:39.083 --> 00:10:43.375
When you see the earth and nature

199
00:10:43.375 --> 00:10:47.333
as an expression of Me,

200
00:10:47.333 --> 00:10:51.041
then you feel

201
00:10:51.041 --> 00:10:56.416
that it deserves respect,

202
00:10:56.416 --> 00:10:58.791
not exploitation.

203
00:10:58.791 --> 00:11:00.750
Just as I

204
00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:05.708
sustain this vast universe,

205
00:11:05.708 --> 00:11:09.791
give you everything,

206
00:11:09.791 --> 00:11:13.791
yet remain untouched,

207
00:11:13.791 --> 00:11:15.375
in the same way

208
00:11:15.375 --> 00:11:18.250
you too in your professional

209
00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:22.500
efforts can find success

210
00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:24.500
without causing harm

211
00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:28.000
to nature.

212
00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.833
Have you ever thought

213
00:11:30.833 --> 00:11:36.416
what it means to be a successful leader?

214
00:11:36.416 --> 00:11:41.166
It means understanding that the environment

215
00:11:41.166 --> 00:11:44.666
is part of the divine order

216
00:11:44.666 --> 00:11:49.083
that I watch over.

217
00:11:49.083 --> 00:11:53.833
When you work with this understanding,

218
00:11:53.833 --> 00:11:59.250
then your business aligns with dharma.

219
00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:02.333
Dedicate your new ideas

220
00:12:02.333 --> 00:12:06.291
not just to your own gain,

221
00:12:06.291 --> 00:12:10.666
but to the broader good.

222
00:12:10.666 --> 00:12:11.958
Progress

223
00:12:11.958 --> 00:12:16.375
and expand your business.

224
00:12:16.375 --> 00:12:21.791
But as you do, ensure

225
00:12:21.791 --> 00:12:26.791
that your work contributes to harmony,

226
00:12:26.791 --> 00:12:29.458
not to destruction.

227
00:12:29.458 --> 00:12:32.375
Just as the lotus

228
00:12:32.375 --> 00:12:36.500
blooms in mud yet remains pure,

229
00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:37.791
in the same way

230
00:12:37.791 --> 00:12:42.541
your professional venture too,

231
00:12:42.541 --> 00:12:48.000
untouched by the dishonest
 tactics of the business world,

232
00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:53.250
can maintain respect for nature.

233
00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:55.666
And remember,

234
00:12:55.666 --> 00:12:58.708
when you honour the earth

235
00:12:58.708 --> 00:13:03.750
as My gift,

236
00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:05.791
then your efforts

237
00:13:05.791 --> 00:13:10.166
become meaningful and fruitful.
